{
  "approach_chosen": "both",
  "rationale": "Both top-down and bottom-up are run in parallel for cross-validation. Top-down: start from the global or US field-service management (FSM) software market, narrow to the SMB HVAC/plumbing/electrical segment, then apply a realistic capture rate for Cadence. Bottom-up: count addressable US HVAC, plumbing and electrical businesses in the small-to-mid size range, multiply by an estimated annual SaaS ARPU, apply a serviceable fraction and a 3-year capture target. Running both independently and comparing gives investors confidence the sizing is not built from a single inflated number.",
  "metadata": {"run_id": "20260929T160205Z"}
}

